{"asset_key":"ep2/gameplay_story_12600080","episode":"ep2","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"12600080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1260008001:1":{"text":"翌日の朝、早速あなたたちのもとへとある知らせが舞い込んだ……","source_cn":"翌日一大早，一个不速之客就带着新消息冲到了你们面前——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97A637031D8B6693","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1260008002:1":{"text":"ブラッディ・マリーのボス！メイジ様！た、大変だ！","source_cn":"各位！！血薇帮的当家！魔法师大人！我来报案！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x35D4AAFFA8DB818B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ブラッディ・マリーのボス！メイジ様！た、大変だ！","female":"ブラッディ・マリーのボス！メイジ様！た、大変だ！","variant_male_record_index":"140424","variant_female_record_index":"140425","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1260008003:1":{"text":"ん？見た顔だな。うちに魚を卸している漁師か？","source_cn":"你……看起来有点面熟，是供鱼的捕鱼人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD99E59DB429636D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1260008004:1":{"text":"へえ、おいらは魚類研究協会定員外メンバーのネイソン、人呼んで「シーウルフ」だ！夢は師匠の「五十キロ」を超える百キロの魚を釣り上げることさ！","source_cn":"没错，我是钓鱼协会编外非记名成员，南森，称号“海狼”！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC07FC65338A5C383","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1260008005:1":{"text":"要点を言え、要点を。何が大変なんだ？","source_cn":"不需要这些无关信息。你有什么要报告？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56DA0E5F9041C629","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1260008006:1":{"text":"いや、大変というか、いい知らせというか。昨日、仲間と夜釣りをしてたら、明け方にでかい魚を何匹も釣り上げたんだよ！","source_cn":"啊，是好事！我和几个同好昨晚夜钓，到天亮左右，一口气钓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56828834491DED27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1260008007:1":{"text":"これなら「百一本釣り」のクソジジイに目に物見せてやれるって師匠も喜んでさ！","source_cn":"师父一直说，这样绝对能给“一零一杆”那个臭老头子点颜色看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3007ED1B28AE9574","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1260008008:1":{"text":"それは、おめでとう。だがなぜ俺たちに？てっきり死体でも引き上げたのかと思ったぞ。","source_cn":"呃，恭喜。但为什么要来报案，我还以为你们钓上来无名尸了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE33EE7F05D47A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1260008009:1":{"text":"ああ、実は……釣り上げた魚があまりにも狂暴で、おいらと師匠じゃ手に負えなくて……","source_cn":"啊，是这样……那些鱼有点太凶了，我和师父一起都没法制服。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x346AF55F84AF3362","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1260008010:1":{"text":"岸に引っ張り上げてからずっと、こっちを刺し殺す勢いで暴れ回るんだ！","source_cn":"上岸之后就开始追着我和师父乱捅，差点要了我们俩的命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF0A938FA7ED1A8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1260008011:1":{"text":"だから走るのが得意なおいらに、ブラッディ・マリーのとこに行って助けてもらえって師匠が……","source_cn":"因为我腿脚比较快，师父就催我们快点来找血薇帮的当家们帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5613DA1AF7E4442E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1260008012:1":{"text":"待ってくれ……魚が？岸の上で、人を刺そうとしてるだと？","source_cn":"——等等等等，鱼？上岸？追着人捅？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC56C1C11C0F4C639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1260008012":{"text":"待ってくれ……魚が？岸の上で、人を刺そうとしてるだと？","source_cn":"——等等等等，鱼？上岸？追着人捅？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC56C1C11C0F4C639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1260008013:1":{"text":"人間よりも大きい魚さ！しかも釣り竿を武器にして、ガオーって叫ぶんだ！","source_cn":"您怎么知道我们钓上了比人还高大的鱼！它们能把鱼竿当做武...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA86528BC83D7C62F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"人間よりも大きい魚さ！しかも釣り竿を武器にして、ガオーって叫ぶんだ！","female":"人間よりも大きい魚さ！しかも釣り竿を武器にして、ガオーって叫ぶんだ！","variant_male_record_index":"140436","variant_female_record_index":"140437","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1260008015:0":{"text":"人間よりデカくて、武器を持ってる……って、どう考えても魚じゃねえだろ！","source_cn":"比人还高大，拿着武器……那根本不是鱼吧？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36BCE9A961F4F0B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1260008016:1":{"text":"もしかして、黒棘（こっきょく）の海の近くに出没する魚の怪物じゃないのか？あ、それなら一応魚になるのか？","source_cn":"你们说的该不是黑棘海附近出没的那些鱼怪吧……呃，这样说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x630E8A5A72022AC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1260008017:1":{"text":"悠長に分析してる場合か。走れ！またあのグレイヴボーンの仕業かもしれん！","source_cn":"别慢悠悠分析了，给我跑起来，可能又是那个亡灵下的手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7042F76DD53F4F4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1260008018:1":{"text":"ちっ、そうだな！行こう！","source_cn":"啧，有道理，我们去看看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC8D80430FE0B1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"どんな姿をした魚なんだ？","source_cn":"那些鱼长什么样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6A4C3DE98841932C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どんな姿をした魚なんだ？","female":"どんな姿をした魚なの？","variant_male_record_index":"67548","variant_female_record_index":"67549","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1260008014:1":{"text":"人間よりも大きい魚さ！おいらよりも頭半分ほどデカいんだ！","source_cn":"您怎么知道我们钓上了比人还高大的鱼！它们比我还高出半个头！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE096CA7F8B467B17","v